Q.1:-Count total no. of employees.

Query:-select count(*) as "Employee Count" from emp;

Output:-

+----------------+
| Employee Count |
+----------------+
|             30 |
+----------------+
1 row in set (0.00 sec)

============================================================================================================================================================================================================================================

Q.2:-Determine the maximum and minimum salary.

Query:-select max(sal) as "Maximum Salary",min(sal) as "Minimum Salary" from emp;

Output:-

+----------------+----------------+
| Maximum Salary | Minimum Salary |
+----------------+----------------+
|           5000 |            800 |
+----------------+----------------+
1 row in set (0.00 sec)

============================================================================================================================================================================================================================================

Q.3:-Display the count of employees having salary greater than 3000.

Query:-select count(*) from emp where sal>3000;

Output:-

+----------+
| count(*) |
+----------+
|        4 |
+----------+
1 row in set (0.00 sec)

